      "summary": "Wisconsin uses countable asset limits for most MSP categories. The published 2025/2026-era limits shown in DHS materials are $9,660 for one person and $14,470 for two people for QMB, SLMB, and SLMB+; QDWI uses a lower asset limit of $4,000 for one person and $6,000 for two people.[1][3]",
