    "type": "financial",
    "value": "Wisconsin Medicare Savings Programs can pay Medicare premiums and, depending on the category, Medicare cost sharing. Specifically: QMB can pay Medicare Part A and Part B premiums, deductibles, and coinsurance; SLMB can pay Medicare Part B premiums; SLMB+ can also pay Medicare Part B premiums; QDWI can pay Medicare Part B premiums.[10]",
